		"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
		"It can be &epowered&r stand alone with external &epower&r, or as part of a &dME Network&r. When on a &bnetwork&r, the storage of the chest will be available to any other devices in the same &bnetwork&r using an assigned Channel."
